## Folder structure (similar to From-WhatsApp, IT content)

Each code folder contains NOSS documents in the same style as `From-WhatsApp/` but for IT-020:

- **00_Contact-hour_…** — Contact hour distribution, work-activities summary (where applicable), and list of CoCu docs with PAGE.
- **01_CoCu-1-…**, **02_CoCu-2-…**, … — One document per competency unit (CoCu) with:
  - **NOSS header table:** PROGRAM CODE AND NAME, LEVEL, UNIT TITLE, WORK ACTIVITY STATEMENT, NO. CODE, PAGE (as in Kitchen sample).
  - **Work activities table:** % Hrs, Work activity, Knowledge 30%, Performance 70%, Total.
  - **Type / Key terms tables:** Type or term with Description (e.g. Type of tools, Hardware components, Key terms).
  - **Learning outcomes table:** Work activity vs Knowledge (30%) and Performance (70%) (sample: Kitchen role descriptions and learning content).

